# Copy to .env for local dev.
#
# Only consulted by routes/api/[...path]/+server.ts's fallback path --
# used under plain `vite dev` (no Cloudflare bindings available at all)
# so the storm dashboard still works against a local `anemoi.api
# --reload` with zero Cloudflare tooling. Ignored under `wrangler dev`
# and in every real deploy, where the ANEMOI_API service binding
# (wrangler.jsonc) is used instead.
#
# Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (the reference `uv run python -m
# anemoi.api` default) if unset.
# ANEMOI_API_LOCAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
